        "id": 1479762
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-13T15:46:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tried with 20 and it didn\u0027t cause watchdog so I left 10 to be on the safe side.\nBetter to do at least 2 cycles to detect if any interrupt is not cleared immediately. I\u0027m fine with any number from 2 to 10, feel free to suggest. Or we can just leave 10",
      "parentUuid": "b5ea4c52_756f5e54",
      "revId": "66d196c553724ad419c380769dbf765e4a069e8b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
