      "writtenOn": "2023-06-13T17:17:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "10 is fine. \n\nI was just trying to understand the reasoning. Are the interrupts buffered and repeated reads are needed to clear? Or is it that it may take a few microseconds for the the interrupt line to deassert?",
